Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing up so early?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you ask? Isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to school early again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:56.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Slow down. What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I just come straight\Nout and ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing this early, and with whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not something bad, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:29.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll get hungry before lunch\Nsince you're leaving this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it. Thanks, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm good. I already ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kayo. You must be bored here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only there was a TV here or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right. Hiromi brought\Nme lots of books yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be all over in\Na day or two, so hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll see you after school, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap! The Izumi Elementary\Nkids are coming in droves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess I spent too long there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna give the farewell\Nspeech at the graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why me? You're better at public speaking, Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I know you can do it, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Muster up the courage and give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.02,0:05:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo's absent again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah. I dropped by her place\Nthis morning, but nobody answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to Hinazuki?\NThink she caught a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dunno, but it's weird that the school hasn't been informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki sure is away a lot.{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Normally her mom would have called.{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna skip school too.{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, knowing Kayo, she'll probably\Nshow up all of a sudden eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we begin class?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you stopped by her place again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be worried.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet you seem to be rather calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like you always say:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At times like these, you need to\Nkeep calm and carry on as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:15.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I called Kayo's house\Nyesterday and today, but nobody answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.34,0:06:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even called her mother's workplace,\Nbut they said she hadn't come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Could you call the\Npolice or the Child Welfare Center?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:29.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, wouldn't it cause a certain\Nsomeone trouble if I called them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I contacted Child Welfare yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said they were going today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to visit Kayo's place with them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we want to eliminate the root cause,\Nwe'll probably have to start there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:47.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I can't turn back after giving you the\N"Whatever you do, always give it your all" spiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So Yashiro had already acted to help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki-san? We're from Ishikari City Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No answer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The lights are on, so somebody must be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go around back and check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki-san, are you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:23.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl's apparently been\Nmissing for three whole days.\NLet's leave this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The lights are on, and so is the heater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A recent meal for one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Kayo's coat is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the very least,\Nher mother was here until just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:08:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She must've escaped out the\Nveranda the moment we rang the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn. We would have at least\Nliked to take the girl into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's come back tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mother probably ran out in her nightwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's sure to come back once we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We could ask the police to look for the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Kayo's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I have an idea of where she could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's take a step\Nback and let the mother settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People from the Child Welfare Center made a visit.\NYashiro-sensei, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mom wasn't home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure things will be settled tonight or tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo, you'll be separated from your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing could make me happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Child Welfare taking custody of Hinazuki Kayo\N{\i1}would also mean we wouldn't see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:09:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking about you guys will\Ngive me warmth and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru. It's a bit late, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,here's your birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your present tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get the feeling I've been waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for this moment forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly emotional, huh, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Satoru. Stay with me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:10:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing really happened,\Nbut someone came in here late last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A security guard on night duty?\NOr maybe the school janitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:09.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any other possibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone came here to hide their dirty mags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:18.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He kicked that cardboard box.\NI think he was mad about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it's just dirty mags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:45.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was the only one who realized\Ninstantly what this stuff was for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it finally hit me that\Nthe serial killer's second victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya, went to Izumi Elementary School.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We were still stuck in the loop of\Nthe serial kidnapping and murder case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:13.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}March 2nd...\N{\i1}At some point between 10 p.m. and 11 p.m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki Kayo disappeared\Nfrom the storage shed at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The rubber boot footprints found nearby, \Nmatched with boots found at the Shiratori home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The killer took her to a commercial freezer\Nand used a spray to speed up her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He then returned her body to the shed before sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:41.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bus is not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's right in the middle of the loop of this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should leave here at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While we'd love for someone to find Hina,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:12:01.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this stuff is kinda disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We can't have a pervert finding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, do you have a plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NLet's get outta here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the killer's footprint. Remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's that black powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Briquettes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me this belongs to the killer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, that stuff doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. Losing my head won't do me any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:13:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad. It was a good hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not when strangers show up late at night, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, I should distance Hinazuki\Nfrom the case, even if I have to push my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Child Welfare is making their move, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:15.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our actions are definitely changing the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This will work for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru...\NThis is your plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep. Simple, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's dig deep and take another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're being straightforward after all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what happened when I didn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:04.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I had a feeling I'd get yelled at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:12.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would I ever yell at you for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it to help a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I noticed it a little while ago, but this smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be home soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:30.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I didn't know how many guests\Nyou'd bring, so I went with curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she knew all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.\NCome in and join us for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:38.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take you up on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you gonna do with\Nall this curry if nobody came?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, curry is good for days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:56.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you. It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, leave it to me to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mean the mess on the dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? This is Fujinuma Satoru's mother speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei, Satoru and\NKayo-chan came back to our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will Kayo really have to be\N sent to an orphanage somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:37.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...\NI've got an idea of sorts\Non how to deal with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we couldn't meet Kayo's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On that note, Fujinuma-san, I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:50.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow at seven, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay the night, Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:03.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello. Sorry for calling so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Yashiro Gaku,\Na teacher at Mikoto Elementary School.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak to you about Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's called Wonder Guy. Isn't he cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of you go ahead and take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:20.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna take one with me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want me to wash your hair, Kayo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling itchy anywhere, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here? Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're 29 years old! Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold if you don't dry your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You seemed to be having fun in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was really warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, those pajamas...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bought them beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use this bed sheet. It's been washed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.66,0:17:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:37.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, you're too sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pull that end more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feels like we're on a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, the view from\NMount Hakodate at night is something else, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never even been to Hakodate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}C-Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I saw it in a photo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't use a nightlight at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, should I turn it off, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's leave it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:33.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I being a third wheel here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who actually says "yeah"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.80,0:18:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:09.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, Kayo-chan! Eat up while it's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, what about the curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:32.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saving it as your dinner for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was enough for a half-dozen people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could just invite your friends over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:55.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where the hell were you these past few days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two!
